9151", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974717_3267266380162484_3578961694161774596_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uLBeK_qB1D0Q7kNvwFkUmqo&_nc_oc=AdrYg_tMyeQLf46QfkuOlDyKCOlkEEnr9HVcYlsKTmzJPCNzKaqHP2d7tMduVxOEP3A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0GL3wxyfdgF3swg3CCViKJgCgNdAdPPZyItgpBVO4SqA&oe=69F0D1D6"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Throw Pillow_Screenshot.png", "id": "3559508997603615", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_3559509000936948_3261126970408815056_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A0A4c1gKpkAQ7kNvwEkVDr5&_nc_oc=AdpI_l37_G4z2MhsrjKyerj0vSeeFVp7MTGgySmps2whzpT_9R0PyWogVTTaNk2jJJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2MIDGljWoeLebxak_Dri0d9vp8txWkBb-1Tx1Q9eEo-A&oe=69F0C8BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FluentXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock a personalized language learning journey through your mixed reality home. FluentXR transforms your space into an interactive learning environment.\n\nStep into a realm where learning is not just fun and effective, but also deeply personalized. FluentXR is not just another language learning app; it's your own private linguistics lab.\n\nTag real-world objects in your space with text and audio labels, making learning immersive and contextually relevant. Dive into our Word Shuffle mini-game to reinforce your skills and challenge yourself using the timer.\n\nCurrent Features:\nSpace: Living Room\nMain Language: English\nLearning: French / fran\u00e7ais\nMini-Game: Word Shuffle\n470+ available tags geared towards common living room objects such as \u201cCouch\u201d, \u201cTelevision\u201d, \u201cChess Set\u201d and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YjVoaQRkfugQ7kNvwFbzTY_&_nc_oc=AdqLwkaEehKJ8YBGxj3FKMhEuc6ow4QjgCzNTL2qC5wmCXKu-YtMTB1K8_ESA3bJIV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1oYWFYA9n3h4CJ2cMwzcQY_fYbyRzMHNc2Gb0f5Lmk6w&oe=69F0BBD5"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B5CHRm2--oIQ7kNvwFt_0LZ&_nc_oc=Adordb5gBBh6c8vvMk9LLLAgvp-sxUFuRojARZUWgzFOL5C98q5PnpJ9ll0WSqxC3Qw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0G2zoS7u0PhI--bpHDJKbMO5Av4geuYTLft6UzopRtqw&oe=69F0A0A7"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR Cover Art.png", "id": "678364797690874", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974640_678364801024207_2897138990588590099_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1xkkDm1ONjQQ7kNvwGMgMmW&_nc_oc=AdoEMV19Hkw8gaNn_qm5dbN18ajvaeqDwlMYbGRsBWVEFlRUbf5foeHPNsdIissJMKg&_nc_